# Walkthrough: Knowledge University Activation

> **Date:** December 30, 2025
> **Status:** ✅ COMPLETE

---

## What Was Built

### 1. Knowledge Indexer
**File:** [scripts/knowledge_indexer.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/scripts/knowledge_indexer.py)

- Scans **149 files** across [.brain/](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/.brain), `docs/`, and root
- Classifies into **7 faculties** (operations, agents, research, strategy, etc.)
- Extracts **180 rules** from [DEVELOPMENT_RULES.md](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/DEVELOPMENT_RULES.md)
- Outputs to [.brain/knowledge_index.json](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/.brain/knowledge_index.json)

---

### 2. Nightly Agent (Upgraded)
**File:** [scripts/nightly_agent.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/scripts/nightly_agent.py)

**5-Step Pipeline:**
| Step | Function | Description |
|:-----|:---------|:------------|
| 0 | 📚 Knowledge Indexer | Updates the index |
| 1 | 🧪 Test Runner | Runs pytest |
| 2 | 👮 Compliance Officer | Checks git log against 180 rules |
| 3 | 📄 Doc Drift | Compares README.md vs app.py |
| 4 | 📋 Digest | Generates daily report |

---

### 3. Cron Setup
**File:** [scripts/setup_cron.sh](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/scripts/setup_cron.sh)

One-command setup for daily 8 AM runs.

---

## How to Activate

```bash
# 1. Set API key
export GEMINI_API_KEY=your_key

# 2. Test manually
python3 scripts/nightly_agent.py

# 3. Install cron (runs daily at 8 AM)
./scripts/setup_cron.sh
```

